            "review_title": "Review at Quang Hue Noodle",
            "review_text": "Bernicakes\nSydney, Australia127 contributions\n0\nGood chicken noodles!\nNov 2017 • Couples\nWe stopped here after a tour of some museum with our local guide. Best way to eat is like a local! The chicken soup was delicious with the fried pancake which was like a puppadam. We had 2 served as it was delicious and very cheap too. Can’t pass this place up.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 11, 2017",
